  palliation. The clinical data are presented concerning the following topics: invasive thermometry, temperature        
  parameter in tumor and normal tissue, toxicity, tumor response, treatment planning, clinical trials and prognostic    
  factors. Clinical results of thermoradiotherapy for advanced or recurrent rectal cancer, cervical cancer and soft     
