20], "studies": [{"study_index": 1, "title": "Thermoradiotherapy of patients with locally advanced carcinoma of the 
rectum", "abstract": "The effectiveness of local hyperthermia was investigated in 56 patients with locally advanced 
carcinoma of the rectum (T4N0M0). All received combined heat and radiation therapy as a pre-operative treatment. The 
control group consisted of 59 patients with the same stage of disease as those who were only irradiated. Both groups of 
